# tsc -b incremental build state. Both were tracked, and the committed copy was
# stale in a way that read as authoritative: tsconfig.app.tsbuildinfo listed 28
# root files, 7 of which no longer exist (components/gamecard.tsx,
# components/sporttoggle.tsx, components/probabilitybar.tsx,
# components/confidencebadge.tsx and their tests, lib/groupgamesbydateandconference.ts).
# Anything reading it as "the current project" gets a file list that is wrong on
# arrival, and it churns the diff of every commit that changes a source file.
# Regenerated by `npm run build`; nothing needs it committed.
*.tsbuildinfo
